#
# Documentation:
#   - https://nightmaretv.net/learn/hdr-tone-mapping (HDR Tone Mapping in IPTV: BT.2390 vs BT.2446 vs Hable, Explained)
#   - https://dev.to/masonwritescode/ffmpeg-hdr-to-sdr-tone-mapping-that-doesnt-look-washed-out-2026-24ie
#   - https://www.shoutcastnet.com/school/understanding-container-formats-mp4-mkv-ts.php
